= Recognized at last

<div class="event-container">
  <img class="face-status" src="img/portraits/wirth.jfif" alt="Dih rose">
  <p>
  Joseph Wirth, once considered a nuisance to the Center party by hardliners and moderates alike. He now finds himself as *the* symbol for the republic's ideals for catholics—a legacy far removed from the political isolation he once faced.
  </p>
</div>

Having gained sway over the moderates of the party, and even some hardliners, he is now the most influential figure within the Center.

